---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { Icon } from 'astro-pure/user'
import { profile } from '../data/profile'
import { href } from '../site.config'
---
<BaseLayout meta={{ title: '', description: 'Haoze Li (sychostar), a computer science undergraduate at Zhejiang University exploring deep learning and AI agents. Notes, projects, and things learned along the way.' }} lang='en' personal>
  <main class='personal-content home'>
    <h1>{profile.name}</h1>
    <p class='home-handle'>@{profile.nickname}</p>
    <div class='personal-prose'>
      <p>Hey, I’m {profile.name}, a CS undergrad at <a href={profile.school.url}>{profile.school.name}</a> &amp; an AI enthusiast.</p>
      <p class='home-about-link'>You can learn more about me on my <a href={href('/about/')}>about page</a>.</p>
      <p>I’m exploring deep learning and AI agents, and I like building things as I learn. Take a look at my <a href={href('/projects/')}>projects page</a> to see what I’ve been working on.</p>
      <p>I write <a href={href('/notes/')}>notes</a> about what I’m learning. There are <a href={href('/courses/')}>course notes</a>, <a href={href('/reading/')}>thoughts on papers and books</a>, and <a href={href('/knowledge/')}>articles</a> about things I’ve tried or figured out.</p>
      <p>When I take a break from studying or coding, I enjoy music, games and so on.</p>
      <hr />
      <div class='personal-contact'>
        <p>Find me @ <a class='social-link' href={profile.github} rel='me'><Icon name='github' color='#8957e5' />GitHub</a>
          <span class='social-item'><span aria-hidden='true'>·</span> <a class='social-link' href={profile.bilibili} rel='me'><Icon name='bilibili' color='#fb7299' />Bilibili</a></span>
          <span class='social-item'><span aria-hidden='true'>·</span> <a class='social-link' href={profile.zhihu} rel='me'><Icon name='zhihu' color='#0084ff' />Zhihu</a></span>
        </p>
        <p>Reach me @ <a class='social-link' href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}><img src={href('/assets/images/gmail.svg')} width='18' height='14' alt='' />Gmail</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
